    "introduction": "Coca-Cola Europacific Partners produces and distributes beverages across territories in Europe, Australia and the wider Asia-Pacific region, including the Philippines. It is a bottling partner that manages manufacturing, packaging, logistics and local sales for Coca-Cola and other drinks. Customers include retailers, restaurants and other outlets serving consumers. Revenue comes from beverage sales, with product mix, pack sizes and pricing influencing margins. Its business depends on local distribution reach and efficient production rather than owning the global Coca-Cola brand. Consumer demand, weather and tourism affect volumes, while packaging, transport and ingredient costs shape the economics of supplying large numbers of outlets.",
